remediations.proposed_fix:
Add Condition block to restrict PutObject to objects with specific metadata or versioning:
"Condition": {"StringEquals": {"s3:x-amz-server-side-encryption": "aws:kms"}}
Alternatively, scope Statement Resource to specific prefixes: "arn:aws:s3:::bucket/prod/restricted/*"

